## Overview

INS13 is LibrePilot’s INS/GPS navigation mode. It uses an Extended Kalman Filter (EKF) to fuse multiple onboard sensors (IMU, magnetometer, barometer) with GPS to estimate a full 13-state representation of vehicle position, velocity, attitude, and gyro bias.

> For EKF theory behind LibrePilot’s INS/GPS implementation, see **INSGPSAlg.pdf** (referenced in the original page).

